"<strong>Setups in the demo:</strong> Star and planet, with its own setups; Two stars, with Sun and red dwarf; Twin stars; Hot star, cool giant; Partial eclipses; Eccentric pair; and a Mystery system with its own button. This worksheet uses <strong>Two stars</strong>.",
